<view class="page journal-page"><view class="section"><view class="eyebrow">STYLE JOURNAL</view><view class="section-title">穿搭，是日常的表达</view><view class="section-english">Notes on dressing</view><view class="body-text journal-intro">同一种从容，不同的色彩与心情。</view></view><view class="journal-list"><view wx:for="{{looks}}" wx:key="key" class="journal-card"><button class="journal-photo" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="openLook"><image src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load/><text class="journal-expand">↗</text></button><view class="journal-copy"><view class="eyebrow">LOOK {{item.number}} / THE EVERYDAY EDIT</view><view class="section-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="body-text">{{item.description}}</view></view></view></view><view class="section"><button class="outline-button" open-type="share">分享穿搭手记 ↗</button></view></view>
